# The toolbar badge says ON where the arrows work and OFF where the user switched them off. ON went blank whenever the tab finished loading after the extension had reported in: a slow page, or a single-page app changing its address. Escape hands the keyboard to the page, which is OFF.
pages/badge-after-load.html
expect-badge:ON
eval:location.hash = 'sent'
wait:1000
expect-badge:ON
key:Escape
expect-badge:OFF
key:Escape
expect-badge:ON
